orig_draw_score_panel           0x000057fc  void %s(void)
orig_level_end_screen          0x00012e08  void %s(void)
frame_toggle       0x00000196  uint16_t %s   flipped every frame of the game loop
frame_phase       0x000001e4  uint16_t %s   0, 1, 0, 1 ...: counts the frames of the loop in twos
freeze_timer         0x00000306  int16_t %s   counted down to 0 once a frame
demo_mode         0x0000022a  int16_t %s   0 the player plays; negative a demo is played back; positive the input is recorded
